{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trucker Joe 2 \u2013 Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trucker Joe is back \u2013 bigger, better, and with even more challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Trucker Joe 2</i>, you build a transport company with a fleet of vehicles, take the wheel of your trucks, and deliver various goods across an open game world. Plan your routes, master challenging roads, and upgrade your trucks to become a successful logistics tycoon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first look at the new game world with improved graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial missions involving the transport of goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic driving physics &amp; revamped economic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The foundation of your own business empire</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Differences compared to the full version:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Limited vehicle selection:</i> The demo includes only 3 trucks and 5 trailers. The full version offers a much wider variety!<br>\u26a0\ufe0f <i>No save/load functionality:</i> Your progress cannot be saved or loaded in the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You handle the transport jobs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/extras/WheelloaderSmallOptimize.gif?t=1744393044\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You place the companies on the map!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/extras/BuildMapSmallOptimize.gif?t=1744393044\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Different companies require specialized trailers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you\u2019ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/extras/MANFrigoNightSmallOptimize.gif?t=1744393044\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Try the Trucker Joe 2 Demo now and get a first impression of the game \u2013 the full version offers so much more!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629540?t=1744393044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/81629a210a9c5e245dc40d4952ebd7dc193f0cdf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744393044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/0e787e8d3e4c4f2b7037966f7a56e00ac31ff511/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744393044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/0e787e8d3e4c4f2b7037966f7a56e00ac31ff511/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744393044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trucker Joe 2 \u2013 Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trucker Joe is back \u2013 bigger, better, and with even more challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Trucker Joe 2</i>, you build a transport company with a fleet of vehicles, take the wheel of your trucks, and deliver various goods across an open game world. Plan your routes, master challenging roads, and upgrade your trucks to become a successful logistics tycoon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first look at the new game world with improved graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial missions involving the transport of goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic driving physics &amp; revamped economic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The foundation of your own business empire</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Differences compared to the full version:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Limited vehicle selection:</i> The demo includes only 3 trucks and 5 trailers. The full version offers a much wider variety!<br>\u26a0\ufe0f <i>No save/load functionality:</i> Your progress cannot be saved or loaded in the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You handle the transport jobs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/extras/WheelloaderSmallOptimize.gif?t=1744393044\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You place the companies on the map!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/extras/BuildMapSmallOptimize.gif?t=1744393044\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Different companies require specialized trailers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you\u2019ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629540/extras/MANFrigoNightSmallOptimize.gif?t=1744393044\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Try the Trucker Joe 2 Demo now and get a first impression of the game \u2013 the full version offers so much more!</strong></h2>","developers":["Sundrum Development"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2818630","name":"Trucker Joe 2"},"genres":[{"descri